},{"data":{"id":"cesumpdzsbk0","created":1633576755629,"text":"selector","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"cesuo7731js0","created":1633576872757,"text":"（多线程版）多客户端时候每个客户端连接创建\n一个线程服务器端内存占用高线程的上下文切换成本高\n等"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"cesuqrwutrs0","created":1633577074580,"text":"（线程池版）在阻塞模式下，在统一时间每个线程只能\n处理一个操作，仅适合短连接连接场景比如http"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"ceu0iy0m1y80","created":1633694947570,"text":"netty组件","layout_right_offset":{"x":-73,"y":-6}},"children":[{"data":{"id":"ceu0j9uvnmo0","created":1633694973345,"text":"EventLoop"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}